Agent SDK 'bughunter' solution copied over labs/m5-agent-sdk/{LANG}/starter — run with --force (starter files always differ from the solution; yours are backed up); post.sh installs deps and, with ANTHROPIC_API_KEY set, runs `bughunter src/paymentservice --ticket` once (budget-capped) so reports/, tickets.json and .bughunter-session exist — otherwise it drops the sample findings file.
